Z||000009||GREENDANO||01-23-2000||11:19 AM||||My turn to b*tch..<BR>  I went to knock the icicles off the back roof so they don't blow out my sliding door glass like two years ago, Knocked a GIANT one down, crushed one of my deck lights, and dropped the remainder on my head.  DOH!  Got a good size bump and scar on my forhead now.  Chicks dig scars, At least my wife kissed it to make it better.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Wink-Wink... Family oriented responses please...---&gt; Monkeyman, you too Cliff.<P>Monkeyman, sounds like a sweet deal on the house!! A house like that in my town in in the 60's to 70's.  30 K is a great deal.  Is the owner intested in financing it himself, or would you get a bank loan?  <BR>  BTW, it was -10F last night, and we've also been stuck in this cold snap on the east coast.<BR>  Dan-O<BR>  ||||reg||1
